  "job_B24.22_20251003_114609": {
    "chunk_text": "iddeneard beofe\u00f0 fram eastd\u00e6le to On \u00fean nige\u00f0en d\u00e6ige tofealle\u00f0 castles, & steples, & hus, & circen, & ealle getimbrunge lytle & On \u00fean ten\u00f0en d\u00e6ige, heo gegaderige\u00f0 ealle deaddre manna lymen, swa \u00fe\u00e6t gyf an mann w\u00e6re dead on On \u00fean \u00e6ndeleften d\u00e6ge eorne\u00f0 wilddeor beo tunen, & felden, & manna wunungen, swa swa heo beon On \u00fean twelften d\u00e6ige eorne\u00f0 m\u00e6nn geond eall middeneard byfigende & dr\u00e6dende Cristes tocyme to Ne heo ne ete\u00f0, ne heo ne drinca\u00f0. On \u00fean \u00fereottende d\u00e6ige fealle\u00f0 sunne & mone, & ealle steorren, for \u00fean \u00fee heo geafen leome \u00fean On \u00fean feowerten\u00f0en d\u00e6ige, ealle libbende m\u00e6nn gewur\u00f0e\u00f0 deade, swa \u00fe\u00e6t heora nan ne by\u00f0 gebyrod, On \u00fean fiften\u00f0e d\u00e6ige cum\u00f0 flod & geswyle\u00f0 \u00fea \u00e6sscen, & bes\u00e6nc\u00f0 ealle \u00fea uncl\u00e6nnyssen into \u00fe\u00e6re.",
